# Hair on cards, steps 3-4 (reports/content/2026-11-npc-hair): the hero's own head with the card hairstyle under the
# three lights of the hair note - a torch (Xardas' tower, the default save), the sun at noon in the Khorinis market,
# the hearth and candle of the harbour house at 22:00. Under each: three quarters from the front and from behind
# (a still each) and a walk of the camera round the head in steps of 45 degrees; in the market also a run from
# behind. The highlights must slide along the strands as the camera goes round, not jump.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with the head> \
#     scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/hair-light.bench <out>
# OPENGOTHIC_HAIR_DEBUG=1 shows the direction of the strands as a colour instead of light (step 3).
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
# 1. A torch: Xardas' tower
set time 12 0
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 70 40 1
wait 6000
shot torch-quarter
wait 300
cam face 70 140 1
wait 2500
shot torch-back
wait 300
cam face 70 0 1
wait 2500
rec torch-round
cam face 70 45 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 90 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 135 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 180 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 225 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 270 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 315 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 360 1
wait 1500
stop
# 2. The sun: noon in the market square, out of the houses' shade (the waypoints around stand in it)
cam cut
set time 12 0
goto pos 7900 270 -4350
watch player
cam face 70 40 1
wait 10000
shot sun-quarter
wait 300
cam face 70 140 1
wait 2500
shot sun-back
wait 300
cam face 70 0 1
wait 2500
rec sun-round
cam face 70 45 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 90 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 135 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 180 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 225 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 270 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 315 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 360 1
wait 1500
stop
walkmode run
cam look 150
cam follow 150 165 180
wait 3000
rec sun-run
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 6000
stop
# 3. The hearth and the candle: the harbour house of perf-interior at 22:00
cam cut
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
watch player
cam face 70 40 1
wait 10000
shot candle-quarter
wait 300
cam face 70 140 1
wait 2500
shot candle-back
wait 300
cam face 70 0 1
wait 2500
rec candle-round
cam face 70 45 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 90 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 135 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 180 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 225 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 270 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 315 1
wait 1500
cam face 70 360 1
wait 1500
stop
